note apps/omega-morph/ommp_morph.om
note Wave 2 Breakthrough #3: Poly-Silicon Chameleon Executables (OMMP01).
note Pure seeded OM-2 builder, fail-closed verifier, and zero-recompile runtime multi-target morpher.
note
note Link order (identical on Linux AArch64 and MacBook target a64macos):
note   si/directives/om2.om
note   apps/omega-wattd/watt_sense.om apps/omega-wattd/watt_cbf.om
note   seed/ng/sha256.om protocol/omnet/om/sha512/sha512.om protocol/omnet/om/ed25519/ed25519.om
note   seed/ng/target/target_desc.om seed/ng/target/chips_tsv.om seed/ng/target/regalloc.om
note   seed/ng/target/isel.om seed/ng/target/sm121_pe.om om/encoder/bw_enc_sm121.om
note   seed/ng/verify/egp3_checker.om apps/omega-morph/ommp_morph.om

